# Impact on Educators

Many educators are surprised by how well AI can help with tasks like drafting lesson plans, giving feedback on writing, and supporting creative activities such as storytelling or brainstorming project ideas.

As the graphic below shows, teachers spend a significant portion of their roughly 50-hour workweek on preparation, grading, and administrative tasks, often outside of direct time with students. These are areas where AI can help save time while keeping teachers at the center of learning.

